	+ September 1835 (start of the evacuations)
	+ April 1836 (end of the evacuations)
	+ April 11, 1836 (privateer "Flash" picked up refugees and survivors of the Runaway Scrape at Morgan's Point)
	+ April 21, 1836 (Battle of San Jacinto)
